<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='mso-outline-level:1'><span style='mso-bookmark:
OLE_LINK2'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='mso-outline-level:1'><span style='mso-bookmark:
OLE_LINK2'><b><span style='font-size:9.0pt'>Exercises –</span></b></span><span
style='mso-bookmark:OLE_LINK2'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:
bold'> <o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='mso-outline-level:1'><span style='mso-bookmark:
OLE_LINK2'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold'><span
style='mso-tab-count:1'>                </span>Staff observed a “source
control” exercise using the hydraulic clamp as well as the source control
training held in preparation of the exercise.<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> 
</span>The clamp resulted from recommendations for improvement after the
Milepost 400 bullet <span class=GramE>hole</span> incident in 2001.<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>A portable pipeline was set up to a small
bladder farm to demonstrate the ability to control the evacuation of crude oil
from the line.<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>Supporting equipment included
fire foam skids and appropriate personal protection.<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>          </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='mso-outline-level:1'><span style='mso-bookmark:
OLE_LINK2'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold'><span
style='mso-tab-count:1'>                </span>Staff also observed a live fire
session at the </span></span><st1:place><st1:PlaceName><span style='mso-bookmark:
  OLE_LINK2'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold'>Fairbanks</span></span></st1:PlaceName><span
 style='mso-bookmark:OLE_LINK2'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:
 bold'> </span></span><st1:PlaceName><span style='mso-bookmark:OLE_LINK2'><span
  style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold'>International</span></span></st1:PlaceName><span
 style='mso-bookmark:OLE_LINK2'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:
 bold'> </span></span><st1:PlaceType><span style='mso-bookmark:OLE_LINK2'><span
  style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold'>Airport</span></span></st1:PlaceType></st1:place><span
style='mso-bookmark:OLE_LINK2'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:
bold'>.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='mso-outline-level:1'><span style='mso-bookmark:
OLE_LINK2'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold'><span
style='mso-tab-count:1'>                </span><b><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'> </span></b><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>               </span><span
style='mso-tab-count:1'>                </span><b><o:p></o:p></b></span></span></p>

